  "steps": [
    "Boil the pasta in salted water until al dente, reserving half a cup of the pasta water, then drain.",
    "Heat the butter and oil in a pan and crackle the cumin seeds.",
    "Add the garlic and onion and sauté until soft and lightly golden.",
    "Add the tomato puree, chilli powder, garam masala and salt and cook for 5 minutes until thick.",
    "Add the capsicum and ketchup and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Toss in the pasta with a splash of the reserved water, cook 1 minute and finish with coriander."
  ]
